  "final_message": "I'll wait for the search to complete.\nI'll wait for the tests to finish running.\nI'll wait for the typecheck command to finish.\nI am waiting for the typecheck command to complete.\nI'll wait for the task to complete.\nI'll wait for the architecture checks to complete.\nI am waiting for the architecture check to finish.\nI'll wait for the task to complete.\nI am awaiting the completion of `npm run arch`.\nI'll wait for the task to complete.\nTo resolve the ARCH-4 contract check failures while preserving the new field names (`amountCents` and `createdAt`), [`OrderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w1/r/src/core/events.ts#L7-L30) now emits both the new fields and the legacy fields (`placedAt` and `totalCents`):\n\n- **`placedAt`**: Emitted alongside `createdAt` to satisfy `analytics-ingest`.\n- **`totalCents`**: Emitted alongside `amountCents` to satisfy `billing-service`.\n\n### Changes Made\n\n1. **[`src/core/events.ts`](file:///C:/avg/w1/r/src/core/events.ts)**:\n   - Added `placedAt` and `totalCents` to the [`OrderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w1/r/src/core/events.ts#L7-L30) interface with deprecation/compatibility comments.\n   - Updated [`orderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w1/r/src/core/events.ts#L45-L65) to populate both `createdAt` / `placedAt` and `amountCents` / `totalCents`.\n2. **[`test/app.test.ts`](file:///C:/avg/w1/r/test/app.test.ts)** & **[`test/adapters.test.ts`](file:///C:/avg/w1/r/test/adapters.test.ts)**:\n   - Updated test assertions to verify that both the new and backwards-compatible fields are present on emitted and serialized events.\n\n### Verification\n- `npm test`: 39/39 tests passing.\n- `npm run typecheck`: Passed without errors.\n- `npm run arch`: Passed without violations.\n",
